{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Upper Blackrock Spire: Solakar Flamewreath fights with Ascension's kit",
  "contract": [
    "Solakar Flamewreath, whom the Father Flame's last wave brings, uses Ascension's kit for him",
    "(db.exil.es/npc/10264) instead of War Stomp: Fierce Blow 975011, Thunder Clap 2102619 and Uppercut",
    "2102513. Supply melee hit, expertise and level-60 two-handed sword skill for the hero, explicitly equip",
    "the original starting Worn Greatsword (49778), and require a living observer and actual native melee",
    "damage before checking combat and kit casts. Skill 1 permits weak glancing blows, and original boss",
    "blocks can deal zero damage; the engagement window allows subsequent ordinary swings. Original boss",
    "spells, location, hit/block rolls and AI are retained. Solakar enters zone combat during initialization,",
    "so the original health-only 2156414 aura is applied before the settling wait; its native",
    "ten-million-health modifier survives subsequent equipment/stat recalculation. Raising a dead player's",
    "health field afterward does not revive it."
  ],
